<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Seven to start Norman golf coverage.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Seven to start Norman golf coverage.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Television broadcaster The Seven Network Ltd said on Friday staff at its Melbourne office had voted to return to work, allowing the station to start coverage of the Greg Norman Golf Classic from 12.00 p.m. (0100 GMT).</p>
<p>&quot;Coverage will start from 12 o'clock,&quot; Seven's publicity manager Lindy Anderson told Reuters.</p>
<p>Seven was unable to cover the first day of the event on Thursday after Melbourne staff along with staff from the company's operations in Brisbane, Sydney and Adelaide called 24 hour strikes earlier this week over Seven's proposal for further job losses.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
